### Typed decisions (default: no API key)
POST http://127.0.0.1:7720/v1/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual",
  "state": "这笔订单被重复扣款了，请财务部门今天把多收的钱退给我。",
  "questions": {
    "department": {
      "type": "choice",
      "instructions": "Which team should handle this message?",
      "criteria": {
        "billing": "payments, invoices, refunds",
        "technical": "software bugs and outages",
        "sales": "pricing and new purchases"
      }
    },
    "refund": {
      "type": "noul",
      "instructions": "Does the sender request a refund?"
    }
  }
}

### Model identity
GET http://127.0.0.1:7720/v1/models
